schema: "0.4"
id: echo-of-manifestation-ui-hud-mockup
type: html
service: anthropic
quality: medium

prompt:
  system: "Generate a complete, self-contained HTML file with inline CSS. Modern, polished visual design. Dark fantasy aesthetic with amber accents on deep indigo-black backgrounds."
  text: >
    Create a dark fantasy game HUD mockup for "Echo of Manifestation" — a survival horror
    roguelite. The HUD should be overlaid on a dark blurred background suggesting the
    Twilight Zone environment. Layout requirements:

    TOP-LEFT: Health Points bar — a horizontal bar with intricate dark metal frame, the
    fill is deep red with amber edge glow, showing current HP as a segmented bar (e.g.,
    73/100). Small alchemical symbol at the bar's end.

    TOP-LEFT (below HP): Essence counter — a circular icon showing an amber crystal with
    a numeric counter (e.g., "x12"). The crystal should have the liquid mercury quality.
    Label: "Essence" in small text.

    TOP-RIGHT: Resonance meter — a vertical meter on the right side showing the
    transmutation resonance level. The meter fills from bottom to top with amber light,
    and has warning markers at 75% and 100%. At higher levels, the meter should appear
    to be crackling with energy. Label: "Resonance" with a small transmutation circle icon.

    BOTTOM-LEFT: Equipped items — two item slots showing currently equipped weapon and
    tool. Each slot is a small square with a dark metal border, containing simplified
    icons: one showing a sword shape, one showing a potion shape. Small keybind labels
    (1, 2) below each slot.

    BOTTOM-CENTER: Minimap — a small circular minimap showing the current zone layout
    in simplified form. The player is an amber dot. Doorways and key landmarks shown
    as dim markers. The minimap has a dark frame with faint alchemical border pattern.

    BOTTOM-RIGHT: Chimera proximity warning — a pulsing amber warning indicator that
    shows when transmuted chimeras are nearby. The indicator should show "CHIMERA
    DETECTED" text with an animated pulse effect. Below it, a small counter showing
    active chimera count (e.g., "Active: 3").

    Style: Dark fantasy UI — deep indigo-black backgrounds with amber (#D4A574) accent
    color. Borders should look like aged dark metal. Text in off-white or amber. Use
    subtle glow effects on active elements. The overall aesthetic should feel like
    alchemical instruments embedded in a dark frame. No rounded corners — use angular
    or chamfered edges to suggest crafted metalwork. Include faint alchemical border
    patterns on UI frames.
  provider_options:
    text_format: html
    max_tokens: 4096

output:
  formats:
    - format: html

tags: [ui, mockup, hud, game-interface, dark-fantasy]
